## 测试命令

```bash
# 全部测试
python -m pytest tests/ -v

# 单个文件 / 单个用例
python -m pytest tests/test_ai_image_text_enhancer_experiment.py -v
python -m pytest tests/test_ai_image_text_enhancer_experiment.py::test_text_l2_upload_in_page_and_default_state -v

# 只跑核心链路
python -m pytest tests/ -m smoke -v

# 跑核心回归
python -m pytest tests/ -m regression -v

# 看得见浏览器（调试）
python -m pytest tests/ -v --headed

# 生成 Allure 报告（pytest 运行后执行）
allure generate reports/allure-results -o reports/allure-report --clean
```

